@startuml
title Device Management System - Component & Deployment Diagram

' ======================
' === DEPLOYMENT NODES ==
' ======================
node "API Layer" {
    component "UserController"
    component "BootstrapController"
}

node "Service Layer" {
    component "UserService"
    component "BlockchainService"
    component "LwM2MNodeParser"
    component "JwtUtility"
    component "ClientInfoRetriever"
    component "BootstrapConfigHandler"
}

node "Integration Layer" {
    component "Web3jClient"
    component "SmartContractInterface"
    component "LeshanModelHandler"
}

node "Data Layer" {
    database "Ethereum Blockchain"
}

node "External Systems" {
    node "Ethereum Node"
}

' ========================
' === COMPONENT LINKS ====
' ========================
UserController --> JwtUtility : authenticates request
UserController --> UserService : requests user operations
UserService --> ClientInfoRetriever : fetches client data
ClientInfoRetriever --> BlockchainService : retrieves client info
BlockchainService --> Web3jClient : invokes smart contract
Web3jClient --> Ethereum Node : communicates

BootstrapController --> JwtUtility : authenticates request
BootstrapController --> BootstrapConfigHandler : submits bootstrap config
BootstrapConfigHandler --> BlockchainService : stores bootstrap data

UserController --> LwM2MNodeParser : sends device data (JSON)
LwM2MNodeParser --> LeshanModelHandler : parses and validates
LeshanModelHandler --> LwM2MNodeParser : returns parsed model

UserService --> BlockchainService : requests user creation
BlockchainService --> SmartContractInterface : executes user add
SmartContractInterface --> Web3jClient : uses web3j methods

' ==========================
' === ERROR HANDLING =======
' ==========================
BlockchainService --> UserService : returns error on failure
UserService --> UserController : propagates error response

@enduml
